  "implementation": "Refresh the position of a successfully reused disposable grid/flex/inline measurement in the existing four-entry vector. Preserve every geometry key, eligibility/input/ownership validator, capacity, snapshot and committed-layout policy. Final hits do not change eviction order. The generated helper specializes to owned pointer-vector writes without cloning/allocation before its optional diagnostic. New tests preserve a frequently reused question through eviction, compare exact uncached geometry after scratch retirement, preserve writable-copy isolation and check final-hit order.",
